---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro"
---
<BaseLayout title="Explore the high-energy universe" description="CAPIBARA is an international, student-led collaboration building the next generation of space observatories.">
  <section class="hero page-width">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Student-led space science</p>
      <h1>Exploring the<br /><em>high-energy</em> universe.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">CAPIBARA is an international collaboration learning about gamma-ray bursts and cosmic rays while designing and building the instruments to detect them.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/about">Discover CAPIBARA <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a><a class="text-link" href="/join-us">Find your place <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="orbit orbit-three"></div>
      <div class="planet"><span></span></div>
      <div class="star star-a"></div><div class="star star-b"></div><div class="star star-c"></div><div class="star star-d"></div>
      <div class="visual-label label-top">LEARNING<br /><strong>BY DOING</strong></div>
      <div class="visual-label label-bottom">CRD <span>•</span> GAMMA<br /><strong>ONE VISION</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="metrics-strip">
    <div class="page-width metrics"><div><strong>02</strong><span>mission programmes</span></div><div><strong>2035</strong><span>constellation horizon</span></div><div><strong>∞</strong><span>ways to contribute</span></div><div><strong>01</strong><span>global collaboration</span></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section page-width">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Two missions · one vision</p><h2>From the classroom<br />to orbit.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Real hardware, real data, real learning. CAPIBARA brings students, researchers, and mentors together around ambitious space science.</p></div>
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <a class="mission-card mission-card-dark" href="/crd"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-index">01 / 02</span><span class="card-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></span></div><div class="mission-icon">CRD</div><h3>Cosmic Ray<br /><em>Detector</em></h3><p>A student-built instrument integrated into the OBA FARADAY CubeSat, designed to distinguish solar and extra-solar cosmic rays in low Earth orbit.</p><span class="card-link">Explore the mission <Icon name="arrow" size={14} /></span></a>
      <a class="mission-card mission-card-purple" href="/gamma"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-index">02 / 02</span><span class="card-arrow"><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></span></div><div class="mission-icon gamma-mark">γ</div><h3>Gamma-ray<br /><em>Astrophysics</em></h3><p>A student-led programme observing gamma-ray bursts and advancing transient astrophysics for the multi-messenger era.</p><span class="card-link">Explore the mission <Icon name="arrow" size={14} /></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="page-width split-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Why CAPIBARA</p><h2>Make your mark<br /><em>on real science.</em></h2></div><div class="split-copy"><p>We are building more than instruments. We are building a lasting model for student-led research where every design document, simulation, and prototype is a chance to learn together.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Read our story <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></a></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section page-width involvement"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Get involved</p><h2>There’s a place<br />for <em>you</em> here.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Whether you are a physics student, engineer, science communicator, advisor, or simply curious about space — come learn with us.</p></div><div class="involvement-grid"><a href="/join-us"><span>01</span><strong>Students</strong><p>Real missions, real data, and real learning. No experience required.</p><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a><a href="/contact"><span>02</span><strong>Advisors</strong><p>Mentor the next generation and join our advisory community.</p><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a><a href="/contact"><span>03</span><strong>Institutions</strong><p>Partner with us through space, expertise, funding, or support.</p><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a></div></section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="page-width cta-content"><p class="eyebrow">The universe is waiting</p><h2>Curious enough<br /><em>to join?</em></h2><a class="button button-light" href="/join-us">Apply to CAPIBARA <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
